e TightSCF parameter in the SCF block, or this parameter would need to be removed if not supported.run_orca Action:I need to debug the input files to fix the error. Let me send one of the input files to the input file service to identify and fix the issue:\nTool used:Tool Name: input_file_service Arguments:message2agent: The ERROR MESSAGE IS \"Unknown identifier in SCF block line 13: Last token: TIGHTSCF.\" Please debug the cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ.inp file and overwrite the current one. The error occurs in all five input files, so fixing one will provide the template for fixing the others.input_file_service Action:   The error in the SCF block was due to the incorrect use of \"TightSCF true\" inside the %scf block. The correct keyword is \"ConvCriteria Tight\". I have fixed the SCF block and overwritten the cn9_-YICLED_OPT_FREQ.inp file with the corrected input. What has been done: -The SCF block now uses \"ConvCriteria Tight\" instead of \"TightSCF true\". -The rest of the input file remains unchanged and correct. -The file was saved as cn9_YICLED_OPT_-FREQ/cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ.inp and is dependent on cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ/cn9_-YICLED_0_nunpairedes_0_charge_0_xtb.xyz. This fix should be applied to all five input files to resolve the error.run_orca Action:Now I need to fix the same issue in the other input files:Tool used:Tool Name: input_file_service Arguments: message2agent: The ERROR MESSAGE IS \"Unknown identifier in SCF block line 13: Last token: TIGHTSCF.\" Please debug and fix the following input files by replacing \"TightSCF true\" with \"ConvCriteria Tight\" in the SCF block: 1. tri_tri_mer_capped_OPT_FREQ/tri_tri_mer_capped_-OPT_FREQ.inp 2. tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_OPT_FREQ/tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_-OPT_FREQ.inp 3. capped_square_antiprismatic_0_OPT_FREQ/capped_square_antiprismatic_-0_OPT_FREQ.inp 4. capped_square_antiprismatic_1_OPT_FREQ/capped_square_antipris-matic_1_OPT_FREQ.inp  The SCF block error (\"Unknown identifier in SCF block line 13: Last token