ethods_level1_3 39 30 31 100 39.00% 30.00% 31.00% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level1_4 112 109 106 327 34.25% 33.33% 32.42% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level1_5 34 33 26 93 36.56% 35.48% 27.96% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level1_6 30 29 27 86 34.88% 33.72% 31.40% Continued on next page Table S4 -continued from previous page Session Reporting Commanding Acting Total Actions Reporting Ratio Commanding Ratio Acting Ratio pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level1_7 38 37 30 105 36.19% 35.24% 28.57% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level1_8 41 40 32 113 36.28% 35.40% 28.32% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level1_9 31 30 25 86 36.05% 34.88% 29.07% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level1_10 45 44 33 122 36.89% 36.07% 27.05% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level2_1 43 36 58 137 31.39% 26.28% 42.34% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level2_2 36 33 46 115 31.30% 28.70% 40.00% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level2_3 23 16 39 78 29.49% 20.51% 50.00% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level2_4 27 26 37 90 30.00% 28.89% 41.11% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level2_5 31 30 49 110 28.18% 27.27% 44.55% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level2_6 41 40 60 141 29.08% 28.37% 42.55% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level2_7 87 86 92 265 32.83% 32.45% 34.72% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level2_8 33 32 51 116 28.45% 27.59% 43.97% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level2_9 32 31 51 114 28.07% 27.19% 44.74% pKaOfCarboxylicAcidsAndMethods_level2_10 23 22 50 95 24.21% 23.16% 52.63% TDDFTforS1andT1_level1_1 121 119 89 329 36.78% 36.17% 27.05% TDDFTforS1andT1_level1_2 33 32 28 93 35.48% 34.41% 30.11% TDDFTforS1andT1_level1_3 27 26 22 75 36.00% 34.67% 29.33% TDDFTforS1andT1_level1_4 29 28 27 84 34.52% 33.33% 32.14% TDDFTforS1andT1_level1_5 48 47 47 142 33.80% 33.10% 33.10% TDDFTforS1andT1_level1_6 21 20 14 55 38.18% 36.36% 25.45% TDDFTforS1andT1_level1_7 24 23 22 69 34.78% 33.33% 31.88% TDDFTforS1andT1_level1_8 68 70 77 215 31.63% 32.56% 35.81% TDDFTforS1andT1_level1_9 22 21 20 63 34.92% 33.33% 31.75% TDDFTfor