± 27.0 137.7 ± 95.2 Level 2 55.4 ± 35.4 54.6 ± 35.9 52.5 ± 30.3 162.5 ± 100.8Figure S1 Success rate of all 120 runs across all 6 exercises as a function of the total number of interactions and total number of tokens. For the tasks we consider, total interactions and total tokens are uncorrelated with success rate (r = 0.05, -0.08), suggesting that the performance of El Agente remains resilient as task depth grows.Table S6 Full run metrics for the university-level exercises.Category Difficulty Run Total Cost (USD) Total Tokens Elapsed Time (s) Organic Compounds Level 1 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level1_1 1.331000 387,865 1575.31 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level1_2 1.575 490,828 1605.05 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level1_3 1.723 675,276 1313.07 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level1_4 2.039 648,303 1589.02 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level1_5 3.335 1,444,334 1706.83 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level1_6 4.442 1,372,911 1901.04 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level1_7 1.398 471,989 1292.52 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level1_8 1.318 459,784 1257.18 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level1_9 2.262 710,398 1650.41 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level1_10 1.300 391,312 1258.41 Organic Compounds Level 2 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level2_1 8.478 3,585,501 2890.47 Continued on next page Table S6 -continued from previous page Category Difficulty Run Total Cost (USD) Total Tokens Elapsed Time (s) OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level2_2 16.210 5,553,054 5234.5 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level2_3 18.329s 6,221,962 4931.9 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level2_4 24.189 9,638,387 5879.81 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimizationAndProperties_level2_5 4.320 1,464,045 3773.92 OrganicMoleculesGeometryOptimiz