_service Arguments: message2agent: The ERROR MESSAGE IS \"Unknown identifier in SCF block line 13: Last token: TIGHTSCF.\" Please debug and fix the following input files by replacing \"TightSCF true\" with \"ConvCriteria Tight\" in the SCF block: 1. tri_tri_mer_capped_OPT_FREQ/tri_tri_mer_capped_-OPT_FREQ.inp 2. tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_OPT_FREQ/tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_-OPT_FREQ.inp 3. capped_square_antiprismatic_0_OPT_FREQ/capped_square_antiprismatic_-0_OPT_FREQ.inp 4. capped_square_antiprismatic_1_OPT_FREQ/capped_square_antipris-matic_1_OPT_FREQ.inp  The SCF block error (\"Unknown identifier in SCF block line 13: Last token: TIGHTSCF.\") in the following input files has been fixed by replacing \"TightSCF true\" with \"ConvCriteria Tight\": 1. tri_tri_mer_capped_OPT_FREQ/tri_tri_mer_capped_OPT_FREQ.inp 2. tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_OPT_FREQ/tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_OPT_FREQ.inp 3. capped_square_antiprismatic_0_OPT_FREQ/capped_square_antiprismatic_0_OPT_-FREQ.inp 4. capped_square_antiprismatic_1_OPT_FREQ/capped_square_antiprismatic_1_OPT_-FREQ.inp Each file was read, the SCF block corrected, and the file overwritten in place. The geometry line and all other settings remain unchanged. Each input file is dependent on its respective xyz file in the same directory. The core specifications for each input file are as previously described.</p><p>run_orca Action: Tool Name: submit_slurm_job Arguments: message2agent: Please submit the following ORCA jobs in parallel again with the corrected input files: 1. cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ (input file: cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ.inp) 2. tri_tri_mer_-capped_OPT_FREQ (input file: tri_tri_mer_capped_OPT_FREQ.inp) 3. tricapped_trigonal_pris-matic_OPT_FREQ (input file: tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_OPT_FREQ.inp) 4. capped_square_-antiprismatic_0_OPT_FREQ (input file: capped_square_antiprismatic_0_OPT_FREQ.inp) 5. capped_square_antiprismatic_1_OPT_FREQ (input file: capped_square_antiprismatic_1_OPT_-FREQ.inp) Each job requires 16 cores as specified in their input files.</p><p>submit_slurm_job Action:</p><p>I'll submit the ORCA jobs again. First, let me check if the input files have been corrected:</p><p>Tool used:</p><p>Tool Name: interact_with_os_and_files Arguments: message2agent: Please check the current content of cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ/cn9_YICLED_-OPT_FREQ.inp to verify if the TightSCF error has been fixed.</p><p>interact_with_os_and_files Action: Tool used: Tool Name: read_file_content Arguments: file_path: cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ/cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ.inp interact_with_os_and_files Action:</p><p>The current content of cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ/cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ.inp includes the following relevant lines for SCF convergence:</p><p>! OPT FREQ PBE0 def2-SVP D4 RIJCOSX DEFGRID2 TightSCF ... \\%scf AutotraH false MaxIter 500 ConvCriteria Tight end The \"TightSCF\" keyword is present in the main command line, and the SCF block specifies \"ConvCriteria Tight\". This indicates that the input is set up to use tight SCF convergence criteria, which should address the TightSCF error. Summary: The input file has been updated to include TightSCF settings, so the error should be fixed.</p><p>submit_slurm_job Action:</p><p>It looks like the input file has been updated with the proper SCF convergence criteria. Let me check if the other input files have also been corrected:</p><p>Tool used: Tool Name: interact_with_os_and_files Arguments: message2agent: Please check the current content of the other input files to verify if they've been corrected: 1. tri_tri_mer_capped_OPT_FREQ/tri_tri_mer_capped_OPT_-FREQ.inp 2. tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_OPT_FREQ/tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_OPT_-FREQ.inp 3. capped_square_antiprismatic_0_OPT_FREQ/capped_square_antiprismatic_0_-OPT_FREQ.inp 4. capped_square_antiprismatic_1_OPT_FREQ/capped_square_antiprismatic_-1_OPT_FREQ.inp interact_with_os_and_files Action: Tool used: Tool Name: read_file_content Arguments: file_path: tri_tri_mer_capped_OPT_FREQ/tri_tri_mer_capped_OPT_FREQ.inp Tool Nam