guments: message2agent: ORCA input for a Ce(III) complex, SCF autotraH OFF, max iterations 500, TightSCF.</p><p>Tool Name: generate_geometry_line Arguments: message2agent: generate the geometry line for cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ_removed2.xyz, the molecule(s) are Ce(III) complex with 3 nitrate_bi and 3 water ligands, the charge and multiplicity are 0 2 Tool Name: generate_geometry_line Arguments: message2agent: generate the geometry line for tri_tri_mer_capped_OPT_FREQ.xyz, the molecule(s) are Ce(III) complex with 3 nitrate_bi and 3 water ligands, the charge and multiplicity are 0 2 Tool Name: generate_geometry_line Arguments: message2agent: generate the geometry line for tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_OPT_FREQ.xyz, the molecule(s) are Ce(III) complex with 3 nitrate_bi and 3 water ligands, the charge and multiplicity are 0 2 Tool Name: generate_geometry_line Arguments: message2agent: generate the geometry line for capped_square_antiprismatic_0_OPT_FREQ.xyz, the molecule(s) are Ce(III) complex with 3 nitrate_bi and 3 water ligands, the charge and multiplicity are 0 2 Tool Name: generate_geometry_line Arguments: message2agent: generate the geometry line for capped_square_antiprismatic_1_OPT_FREQ_removed.xyz, the molecule(s) are Ce(III) complex with 3 nitrate_bi and 3 water ligands, the charge and multiplicity are 0 2 generate_geometry_line Action:</p><p>• xyzfile 0 2 cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ_removed2.xyz global_memory_expert Action: %MaxCore 4000 Configuration_Recommender Action: wB97M-V def2-SVPD pal_block_expert Action:</p><p>Task Completed: Configured the ORCA %pal block for a Ce(III) complex input to use 16 cores for parallelization, as requested. This is within the recommended range for the Mariana cluster (4-24 cores, with a maximum of 24). No advanced settings (such as nprocs_group) were specified, as the user did not request them.</p><p>No errors encountered. The %pal block to include in the ORCA input is: \\%pal nprocs 16 end input_file_service Action: Tool used: Tool Name: repl_tool Arguments: code: omitted for brevity... input_file_service Action: The ORCA input files for single point (SP) calculations for all 5 conformers have been generated with the following specifications: • Calculation: SP (single point) • Functional: wB97M-V (ωB97M-V) • Basis set: def2-SVPD for all atoms, def2-ECP for Ce (via %basis block) • VV10 nonlocal dispersion correction • SCF autotraH: OFF • TightSCF (in keyword line) • 16 cores (%pal nprocs 16) • Max iterations: 500 for SCF • Global memory: %maxcore 4000 • Charge: 0, Multiplicity: 2 (geometry line references the correct xyz file for each conformer) • Output block included as per best practice The input files and their dependencies are: 1. cn9_YICLED_SP/cn9_YICLED_SP.inp (depends on cn9_YICLED_SP/cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ_removed2.xyz) 2. tri_tri_mer_capped_-SP/tri_tri_mer_capped_SP.inp (depends on tri_tri_mer_capped_SP/tri_tri_mer_capped_OPT_-FREQ.xyz) 3. tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_SP/tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_SP.inp (depends on tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_SP/tricapped_trigonal_prismatic_OPT_FREQ.xyz) 4. capped_-square_antiprismatic_0_SP/capped_square_antiprismatic_0_SP.inp (depends on capped_square_-antiprismatic_0_SP/capped_square_antiprismatic_0_OPT_FREQ.xyz) 5. capped_square_an-tiprismatic_1_SP/capped_square_antiprismatic_1_SP.inp (depends on capped_square_antipris-matic_1_SP/capped_square_antiprismatic_1_OPT_FREQ_removed.xyz) All files have been stored in the correct directories. The core specifications for each input file are as Tool Name: read_file_content Arguments: file_path: capped_square_antiprismatic_1_SP/capped_square_antiprismatic_1_SP.inp interact_with_os_and_files Action: Here is the summary of the number of cores required and the dependent files for each ORCA input file: 1. cn9_YICLED_SP/cn9_YICLED_SP.inp • Number of cores: 16 (specified by nprocs 16 in the %pal block) • Dependent file: cn9_YICLED_SP/cn9_YICLED_OPT_FREQ_removed2.xyz 2. tri_tri_mer_capped_SP/tri_tri_mer_capped_SP.inp •